{"version":1,"content":"<p>Macro Risk Advisors（MRA）的專業人士發現了一起異常操作：10月12日，有人在英偉達股票上建立了一系列大幅虛值、將於明年1月到期的看跌期權頭寸。具體而言，MRA的約瑟夫·奈爾斯（Joseph Niles）表示，這名神秘交易者買入了18萬份行權價為150美元的看跌期權，同時賣出了28萬份行權價為100美元的看跌期權。這筆交易的初始成本約為800萬美元。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586274.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T13:21:56.844073+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":191,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T12:54:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T13:15:15.068863+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T13:15:15.068863+00:00","content_hash":"71c5a88d00a3daa4763fb38b15847f96e0796d86bb65d3f6b919b4bf7aeb13f2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}